{{smaller block|Deliver me not over unto the ''will'' of mine enemies.
{{right|Ps. xxvii. 12.}}}}

{{smaller block|The Prince was so devout and humble that he submitted his Body to be chastised at the ''Will'' of Dunstan Abbot of Glastenbury.
